WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.694
Nurses play a vital role in ensuring accurate blood culture collection.

2
00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:07.765
Verifying the patient's identity.

3
00:00:07.765 --> 00:00:09.318
Explaining the procedure.

4
00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:13.459
Maintaining strict aseptic technique throughout the collection process.

5
00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:16.047
Collecting the correct blood volume.

6
00:00:16.047 --> 00:00:18.118
Labelling the specimens accurately.

7
00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:23.812
Monitoring the patient for any complications such as bleeding or dizziness.

8
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:31.059
And documenting all relevant details appropriately, to ensure proper communication and continuity of care.

